Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:15.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,425)}Beat Down! Down! Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:18.69,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,425)}いざEn-Joy! Joy! Joy! Let’s Get Over!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.69,0:22:23.19,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,425)}クレジット入れた瞬間に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.19,0:22:26.70,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,425)}広がる世界 interaction
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.70,0:22:28.35,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,425)}What a fresh experience!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.35,0:22:31.30,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,425)}いつの間にかみんなで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.30,0:22:33.70,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,425)}楽しんだり
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.70,0:22:37.21,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,425)}熱くなったり
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.21,0:22:40.71,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,425)}ハマったり
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.71,0:22:46.13,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,425)}ボコボコにやられてへこんだりと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.38,0:22:49.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,作る思い出
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.55,0:22:52.64,EDJP,,0,0,0,,賑わうこの空間で
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.95,0:22:56.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,たまには Like a superhero に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.55,0:23:02.46,EDJP,,0,0,0,,誰でもなれるかもしれない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:05.68,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1900,320)}Anytime we enjoy them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.68,0:23:07.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1900,320)}Anytime we love it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.65,0:23:11.16,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1900,320)}日々更新される楽しさの理論値
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.16,0:23:12.84,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1900,320)}So here’s the wonderland!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.84,0:23:14.66,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1900,320)}Why don’t you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.66,0:23:17.04,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1900,320)}失敗してもう一回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:18.12,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1900,320)}次も一緒にね
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.12,0:23:20.10,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,330)}Chance! Chance! Chance!　つかめ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.10,0:23:21.46,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,330)}Luck! Luck! Luck!　パワー
